CHAPTER.VERS:
But concerning the times and the seasons, brothers, you

          {+}
         have no need that anything be written to you

          {+}
        .

But you

          {+}
        , brothers, are not in darkness, that that day should overtake you

          {+}
         as a thief:

for you

          {+}
         are all sons of light, and sons of the day: we are not of the night, nor of darkness;

Therefore exhort one another, and build each other up, even as also you

          {+}
         do.

But we urge you

          {+}
        , brothers, to know those who labor among you

          {+}
        , and are over you

          {+}
         in the Lord, and admonish you

          {+}
        ;

And we exhort you

          {+}
        , brothers, admonish the disorderly, encourage the fainthearted, support the weak, be long-suffering toward all.

in everything give thanks: for this is the will of God in Christ Jesus toward you

          {+}
        .

And may the God of peace himself sanctify you

          {+}
         wholly; and may your

          {+}
         spirit and soul and body be preserved entire, without blame at the coming of our Lord Jesus Christ.

Faithful is he who calls you

          {+}
        , who will also do it.

I adjure you

          {+}
         by the Lord that this letter be read to all the brothers.

The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with you

          {+}
        .
